<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound o/n narrow, one-week fall.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound o/n narrow, one-week fall.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound narrowed in a liquid private-sector market on Thursday to between seven and 8-1/4 percent compared to Wednesday's range of seven and 8-3/4 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates fell to between seven and eight percent from eight and 8-1/2 percent on Wednesday, they added.</p>
<p>The public sector retained its lending rate at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
